From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phil Reif <pr@sambal.net>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 20:31:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(frontend): collapse runs of dice bot rolls in the
 timeline

Consecutive dice rolls of one bot (messages with a #chatto-dice marker)
become one dice-group virtual item. The newest roll stays visible, and a
toggle below it shows the earlier rolls. Day and unread separators break a
run. Read position, jumps, recovery and scroll anchoring handle the group.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
